{
  "id": 1720,
  "name": "salty-herba-mystica",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "sandwich-ingredients",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/53/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "幻と呼ばれる　調味料の　ひとつ。まろやかな　その塩味には　すさまじい健康促進の　効果が　あるという。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "환상이라 불리는 조미료의 일종. 부드러운 짠맛에 어마어마한 건강 증진 효과가 있다고 한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "被冠以幻之名的調味料之一。據說其順口的鹹味帶有極為顯著的增進健康之效。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un des condiments considérés comme fabuleux. On raconte que sa rondeur salée a de prodigieux effets bénéfiques sur la santé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eines der Würzmittel, die als mystisch gelten. Seinem sanften, salzigen Geschmack wird eine nahezu sagenhaft anmutende gesundheitsfördernde Wirkung nachgesagt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Uno de los condimentos considerados de leyenda. Se dice que, además de un suave sabor salado, aporta innumerables beneficios para la salud.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Uno dei condimenti definiti leggendari. Il suo gusto rotondo e salato avrebbe effetti prodigiosi per la salute.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the condiments spoken of as legends. Its mellow saltiness is said to be tremendously effective when it comes to promoting health.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "幻と呼ばれる　調味料の　ひとつ。まろやかな　その塩味には　すさまじい健康促進の　効果が　あるという。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "被以奇幻来形容的调味料之一。醇美的咸味在促进健康上据说有着惊人的效果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
